ved_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-01-06T19:12:06Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T16:17:56Z","closed_at":"2026-01-08T16:16:54Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114657","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114657","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114657.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114657.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-08T16:16:54Z"},"body":"This is a bit of a follow up to the underlying issue behind https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114313.\r\n\r\nI'm keeping it as a draft until I can run a few more verifications that it fixes the issues I presume are related.\r\n\r\nIn short, we have a pretty big off by one error in the mobile renderer because immutable samplers are used. Because immutable samplers are skipped when counting the descriptors required for the pool, it is adding one less descriptor than what is necessary.\r\n\r\nThe easiest way to reproduce the issue at the moment is to force the following project setting to 1. This basically forces the pools to only be able to hold one descriptor set at a time. Because the pool is never big enough to fit even one descriptor set, creating the set will always fail.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"973\" height=\"67\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2881eb70-661e-47ac-94b2-d80d1cd1b6f0\" />\r\n\r\nOn AMD, Adreno and Mali, any project I use with the mobile renderer fails to create uniform sets if this value is configured as such. The PR fixes that. NVIDIA apparently does not care, and you can even set pool descriptor sizes to 0 and it will not crash, leading me to believe the driver does the underlying allocation elsewhere.\r\n\r\nI have a pretty big suspicion that the fragmentation errors reported on the PR were related to this. While the logic it adds can and should be kept to make the application more robust, it seems the underlying issue was much more subtle than imagined.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","grava